      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable that you feel this way when everything you built seems to have crumbled so suddenly. The feeling of being a mistake is a heavy burden, but that feeling is a symptom of the pain, not a statement of fact about your worth. Even when the world feels like it's turned away, taking one small step toward professional support can be the first way to start rebuilding a sense of self. Please consider connecting with a counselor who can help you navigate this overwhelming sense of loss.",
      "source": "target",
